{"attempts": 1, "block_types": {"text": 1, "thinking": 1}, "error": null, "http_status": 200, "id": "c-ed-002", "raw": "The diagnosis was coded only as written. The provider documented \"urinary retention\" and did not link it to the surgery or anesthesia. Under ICD-10-CM guidelines, a postoperative complication code (N99.x) needs a documented cause-and-effect relationship, so it is not assigned here. Nothing in the note points to a specific type of retention, such as drug-induced, so the unspecified code is used.\n\n- **R33.9 \u2013 Retention of urine, unspecified:** This is the reason for the visit and the documented diagnosis.\n- **Z90.49 \u2013 Acquired absence of other specified parts of digestive tract:** This captures the status after cholecystectomy two days ago. It is optional but supported by the note.\n- **No external cause codes:** The note does not document an injury or an adverse effect that would call for one.\n\n[\"R33.9\", \"Z90.49\"]", "reply_id": "msg_011ChD7jBos82uxt7AKChP37", "reply_model": "claude-opus-5-5", "request_chars": 1431, "seconds": 5.857, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "turn": 1, "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 516, "output_tokens": 568, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 288}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}
{"attempts": 1, "block_types": {"text": 1, "thinking": 1}, "error": null, "http_status": 200, "id": "c-ent-002", "raw": "Outpatient coding rules (Section IV.H) do not allow uncertain diagnoses like \"probable\" to be coded. So the probable benign paroxysmal positional vertigo of the right ear (H81.11) is not reported. The documented symptom, vertigo, is coded instead. In the Index, \"Vertigo\" without further specification leads to R42 (Dizziness and giddiness), which has no laterality. No external cause codes apply.\n\n[\"R42\"]", "reply_id": "msg_011ChD7jbLxx5cHuxpAxJ4om", "reply_model": "claude-opus-5-5", "request_chars": 1357, "seconds": 3.279, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "turn": 1, "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 499, "output_tokens": 287, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 137}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}
